  Slug: barrow-s-edge
  DisplayName: Barrow's Edge
  IconPath: icons/weapons/swords/sword-hooked.webp
  Description: "Usage melee weapon that deals slashing or piercing damage This blade
    subtly rattles in its scabbard, as if it wants to be unsheathed so it can consume
    violence. Immanence The barrow's edge deals 1 additional spirit damage per weapon
    damage die to a creature it Strikes. If the creature is below half its maximum
    Hit Points, the weapon deals 3 additional spirit damage per weapon damage dice
    instead. Barrow's edge rattles more strongly when an enemy below half its maximum
    Hit Points is within the weapon's reach to let you know a foe is verging closer
    to death. Transcendence\u2014 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Drink of
    my Foes] 1 (healing, transcendence, vitality) @Embed[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.vZwa0PZLQvm3X5ME
    inline]"
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder War of Immortals
  SourcePack: classfeatures
  Rarity: common
